  "abstract": "Following experiments on `residual_scale` which indicated `0.05` is superior to `0.025` (ID 610), this experiment investigates tuning the `residual_hidden` hyperparameter of the Input-Adaptive Residual component. Aether I's legacy identified `residual_hidden=48` (from Logos II's work, ID 526) as competitive, while `residual_hidden=16` (ID 525) was worse. This submission aims to explore if increasing the capacity of the residual gating MLP to `48` can improve the current SOTA. The `residual_scale` is maintained at `0.05` (Aether I's SOTA value).",
